provenance.prompt:
Create eight distinct complete right-facing layup poses for Accu in an original 1536×1024 transparent RGBA pixel-art sheet, strict 4-column by 2-row grid, row-major. Use the attached Accu gameplay art only as canon identity, kit, scale and crisp arcade-pixel reference. Put one whole figure in each cell, with transparent spacing for every hand, shoe and both long ponytails. Keep stable camera and feet baseline. No basketball, hoop, rim, court, shadow, text, grid, props, or other people.

Accu is a stylish young adult human woman with warm tan skin, vivid green eyes, blunt black bangs, closely cropped sides, and two long black twin ponytails with teal ties/highlights. She wears sleek tailored black sportswear with teal and violet trim, dark shorts/tights, black arm sleeves and teal/violet shoes. Keep her feminine face, twin ponytails, green eyes, cropped sides, human anatomy and uniform consistent. She has two arms, two natural hands, two legs and shoes. The ball is separate game art and must never appear in the sprite sheet.

This is a quick right-facing one-handed layup, distinct from a jump-shot gather. Eight connected poses and event timing:
0 moving toward basket with controlled approach stride;
1 takeoff plant and upward drive at simulation tick2;
2 rise off the lead foot, opposite knee lifts and ball-miming hand protects the invisible ball;
3 ascent continues toward the rim, shooting elbow flexes;
4 RELEASE at tick10: high hand extends toward image-right, palm/wrist finishes a soft one-handed layup and is empty;
5 at the peak, follow through with fingertips aimed to the target;
6 descend with knee tucking and shooting arm lowering;
7 controlled landing and recovery stance.

Draw all eight as genuinely different readable pixel-art full-body poses with consistent identity and scale. Right-facing approach and layup toward image-right. Keep hands empty and do not draw a ball. Transparent RGBA with alpha-zero background/gutters; no glow, checkerboard or matte. Return only the sheet.
